{# Specific context for the brief summary of Section 10 (Patch Timeliness) #}
{% set output_format_description = "a single, concise sentence (maximum 2 sentences) summarizing the main conclusion about the relationship between patch delay and risk from this section" %}

{% block task_instructions %}
Read the generated narrative, chart insight, and callouts provided below for "{{ section_title }}", which focuses on patch/disclosure delay versus risk.
